{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"KDE.KDiff3","latestVersion":"1.12.6","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.987a21cc.png","priority":1,"sha256":"987a21cc9810e1f6dce7c313e0e7103fffcdca8a74c951417c1c5bc4e3d8df40","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Diff/Patch Frontend","license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://invent.kde.org/sdk/kdiff3/-/blob/HEAD/COPYING","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Diff/Patch Frontend","license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://invent.kde.org/sdk/kdiff3/-/blob/HEAD/COPYING","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"KDiff3 is a file and folder diff and merge tool which\n- compares and merges two or three text input files or folders,\n- shows the differences line by line and character by character(!),\n- provides an automatic merge-facility,\n- has an editor for comfortable solving of merge-conflicts,\n- provides network transparency via KIO,\n- has options to highlight or hide changes in white-space or comments,\n- supports Unicode, UTF-8 and other file encodings,\n- prints differences,\n- supports version control keyword and history merging.","moniker":"kdiff3","name":"KDiff3","packageUrl":"https://apps.kde.org/kdiff3/","publisher":"KDE e.V.","publisherUrl":"https://kde.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://invent.kde.org/sdk/kdiff3/-/blob/HEAD/ChangeLog","tags":["compare","diff","file","folder","merge","patch"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Diff/Patch 前端","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"KDiff3 是一个比较、合并文件和文件夹的工具，包括：\n- 比较、合并输入的两个或三个文件和文件夹，\n- 按单行或单字符显示差异(!)，\n- 提供自动合并功能，\n- 拥有轻松解决合并冲突的编辑器，\n- 通过 KIO 提供网络文件透明访问，\n- 可选高亮或隐藏空白字符和代码注释的更改，\n- 支持 Unicode、UTF-8 和其它文件编码，\n- 打印差异，\n- 支持版本控制关键词和历史合并。","publisherUrl":"https://kde.org/zh-cn/","tags":["diff","patch","合并","文件","文件夹","比较"]}},"longDescription":"KDiff3 is a file and folder diff and merge tool which\n- compares and merges two or three text input files or folders,\n- shows the differences line by line and character by character(!),\n- provides an automatic merge-facility,\n- has an editor for comfortable solving of merge-conflicts,\n- provides network transparency via KIO,\n- has options to highlight or hide changes in white-space or comments,\n- supports Unicode, UTF-8 and other file encodings,\n- prints differences,\n- supports version control keyword and history merging.","moniker":"kdiff3","name":"KDiff3","packageUrl":"https://apps.kde.org/kdiff3/","publisher":"KDE e.V.","publisherUrl":"https://kde.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://invent.kde.org/sdk/kdiff3/-/blob/HEAD/ChangeLog","tags":["compare","diff","file","folder","merge","patch"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.12.6/app.json","detailSha256":"cc23d23c09b409560c921c9c0f436130680e3eba1ce00c3fe415d47e72767651","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.12.6"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.12.4/app.json","detailSha256":"dcfc275bc88bc88c2ce5093b509d876c3f89786b2227be5a88047bda57e7aba6","version":"1.12.4"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.12.3/app.json","detailSha256":"452b72264524d6de35b2faff56c1bc82cd84438fe235974fdc5b3e97d447421f","version":"1.12.3"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.12.2/app.json","detailSha256":"82593133e3d1f6aaa602ebac0cd3d33fdecb365087bf7ad20aa8434098e3ffe3","version":"1.12.2"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.12.1/app.json","detailSha256":"dbab0a3b37926e92981b248e6bba06e38a3f0d9a715b6c36f05b4ff821cfa111","version":"1.12.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.12.0/app.json","detailSha256":"18f648391c1921e6006a3b1d6cc28200cf042bb2ffb63fd29f92a02990e3b766","releaseDate":"2024-12-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.12.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.11.5/app.json","detailSha256":"cc7525e8937c08a0eaf07dfff18135d3dcfdde9a6b966b37f9718743b314c92c","releaseDate":"2024-11-07","releaseDateSource